<title>USA: Questron says stock split effective Jan 3.</title>
<headline>Questron says stock split effective Jan 3.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Questron Technology Inc said Thursday its previously announced one-for-10 reverse stock split of issued and outstanding common stock will go into effect Jan 3.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that for about 20 trading days, its common stock symbol will be &quot;QUSTD,&quot; after which it will return to &quot;QUST.&quot;</p>
</text>
